{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan! Hope you're doing good. Got some good news to share - I'm a Weight Watchers coach in my group now! It's a pretty big accomplishment for me, feel really proud."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-564a6383bb87a0f3a46c09ad", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:01.946580+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "564a6383bb87a0f3a46c09ad", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "564a6383bb87a0f3a46c09ad", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Congrats Sam! That's awesome! I'm super proud of you. Becoming a Weight Watchers coach is a big deal. Keep going!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-ec6f0be80ef64865cf21ae5e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:06.069568+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ec6f0be80ef64865cf21ae5e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ec6f0be80ef64865cf21ae5e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! Appreciate your support. It's been a journey, and being chosen as a coach is a great step in my quest for better health."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-53414bca5ab5465fe9e88fab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:10.209287+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "53414bca5ab5465fe9e88fab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "53414bca5ab5465fe9e88fab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Wow, Sam! You've come such a long way. It's exciting to see what comes next for you in your quest for better health."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-53161d4e8e86dbe089eef9e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:14.346765+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "53161d4e8e86dbe089eef9e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "53161d4e8e86dbe089eef9e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! It feels great to see progress. Being a coach will hopefully keep me motivated and help others stay committed too. It's a big challenge, but I'm ready for it!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-1b905b8dbcde634b16a0ddac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:18.473125+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1b905b8dbcde634b16a0ddac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1b905b8dbcde634b16a0ddac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: That's awesome, Sam! Helping others stay committed and motivated is so rewarding. You really inspire us. Keep up the great work!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-05055a2dad7c3beaabb354fe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:22.564784+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "05055a2dad7c3beaabb354fe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "05055a2dad7c3beaabb354fe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! Your kind words mean a lot. It's been a difficult road, but I'm determined to continue making a positive impact."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-becaebc86e1a162d062d00b8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:26.675516+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "becaebc86e1a162d062d00b8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "becaebc86e1a162d062d00b8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Sorry about missing any events, I've had some personal challenges since we last spoke. Still here for you though - do you need any support or want to share anything? Btw look what i got!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-aa9c791e9ed12d096d5c60cf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:30.818926+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aa9c791e9ed12d096d5c60cf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aa9c791e9ed12d096d5c60cf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey, it looks so vintage and cool! What model is it? How've you been doing lately? I'm here if you wanna chat."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-0446f404fe1d3135c957fe33", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:34.955576+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0446f404fe1d3135c957fe33", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0446f404fe1d3135c957fe33", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: It's a 1968 Kustom K-200A vintage guitar and I got it as a gift from a close friend. It's been a tough time for me since we last caught up; I lost my job last month, which has been pretty rough. But I really appreciate your support through all this."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-ce2271f3e84561607fcecfc8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:39.052077+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ce2271f3e84561607fcecfc8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ce2271f3e84561607fcecfc8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Sorry to hear about your job, Evan. What happened?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-296c7c298df4d30df115f569", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:43.126599+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "296c7c298df4d30df115f569", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "296c7c298df4d30df115f569", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: It's been a bit of a rough patch lately. The company downsized, and I was part of that. I'm currently on the hunt for a new job, which hasn't been easy, but I'm keeping my spirits up and staying hopeful."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-2d89f9482f63d3475a2b15b1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:47.275333+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2d89f9482f63d3475a2b15b1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2d89f9482f63d3475a2b15b1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Sorry about your job, Evan. It's tough when it comes out of nowhere, but I'm proud of how you're handling it. Let me know if you need someone to talk to or if I can do anything to help. You'll get through this."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-62a2d28e63a476ed6ad6cbea", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:51.376377+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "62a2d28e63a476ed6ad6cbea", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "62a2d28e63a476ed6ad6cbea", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam. Your support means a lot. It's been quite a ride, but I really appreciate having someone like you to talk to. I'll definitely reach out if I need anything."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-0027e0b5bb077258dc977145", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:55.517464+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0027e0b5bb077258dc977145", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0027e0b5bb077258dc977145", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: For sure, Evan! I'm here for ya. Life can be tough sometimes, but we got this. Stay positive and it'll all work out. Just know that I'm here if you need someone to talk to."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-3ece85258378a861d86a7486", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:24:59.656305+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3ece85258378a861d86a7486", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3ece85258378a861d86a7486", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam. Your kind words and support mean a lot. It's great to have you here. I'm gonna stay positive and keep going. Cheers!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-49/session_16-9b6fd8bc56d37d35ec99b5f7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:25:03.775391+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9b6fd8bc56d37d35ec99b5f7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9b6fd8bc56d37d35ec99b5f7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
